### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

###

### Get existing ticket
# Replace with a real MongoDB _id after creating a ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID

###

### Get missing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000

###

### Create a valid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop won't power on",
  "description": "Employee laptop is completely unresponsive.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "farah@example.com"
}

###

### Create an invalid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}